6:["$","p","social media detox is one of the best tip to overcome homesickness, constantly checking your social media, checking about what people or your home friends are doing could make your homesickness even worse. The reels, the posts, the stories you never noticed normally you would start overthinking it more when you are away, you would want your old comfort life back, you would miss your home food, home place, old friends etc. you could build a feeling of giving up and going back to normal but instead of nagging yourself continuously on how things would have been different if you never came to abroad you should take a social media detox which has only pro’s . 1) it could help you with improving your mental health. 2) it could divert your mind from reel life to real life.",{"children":"social media detox is one of the best tip to overcome homesickness, constantly checking your social media, checking about what people or your home friends are doing could make your homesickness even worse. The reels, the posts, the stories you never noticed normally you would start overthinking it more when you are away, you would want your old comfort life back, you would miss your home food, home place, old friends etc. you could build a feeling of giving up and going back to normal but instead of nagging yourself continuously on how things would have been different if you never came to abroad you should take a social media detox which has only pro’s . 1) it could help you with improving your mental health. 2) it could divert your mind from reel life to real life."}]
7:["$","p","How to take a social media detox?",{"children":"How to take a social media detox?"}]
8:["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Homesickness won’t go overnight :-",{"children":"Homesickness won’t go overnight :-"}],["$","li","Talk to your loved ones(not everyday):-",{"children":"Talk to your loved ones(not everyday):-"}],["$","li","Social media detox:-",{"children":"Social media detox:-"}]]}]
9:["$","section","i) Let people know :-",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"i) Let people know :-"}],[["$","p","The first step to taking a social media detox is to tell people.",{"children":"The first step to taking a social media detox is to tell people."}],["$","p","Let people you interact the most know that you won’t be online for a while. This will do a few things.",{"children":"Let people you interact the most know that you won’t be online for a while. This will do a few things."}],["$","p","First, it will keep you accountable. If you’re back within a few days posting stories and posts the people you informed might call you out on it. This will help you stick with the detox.",{"children":"First, it will keep you accountable. If you’re back within a few days posting stories and posts the people you informed might call you out on it. This will help you stick with the detox."}],["$","p","Secondly, it will let people know you haven’t disappeared if you wind up sticking with it.",{"children":"Secondly, it will let people know you haven’t disappeared if you wind up sticking with it."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
a:["$","section","ii) Delete your social media apps:-",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"ii) Delete your social media apps:-"}],[["$","p","This step is required. I can guarantee you that you won’t succeed, if you keep those apps on your phone during your detox you’ll only check them once a week.",{"children":"This step is required. I can guarantee you that you won’t succeed, if you keep those apps on your phone during your detox you’ll only check them once a week."}],["$","p","For this to work, you’ll need to disconnect completely. If that seems too hard, try a shorter detox.",{"children":"For this to work, you’ll need to disconnect completely. If that seems too hard, try a shorter detox."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
b:["$","section","iii) Plan what you will do during your detox :-",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"iii) Plan what you will do during your detox :-"}],[["$","p","after deleting your social media apps you would wonder how much extra time you have with yourself. Plan what you will do during your detox and actually applying it or doing it in your spare time.",{"children":"after deleting your social media apps you would wonder how much extra time you have with yourself. Plan what you will do during your detox and actually applying it or doing it in your spare time."}],["$","p","Some suggestions that I found useful:",{"children":"Some suggestions that I found useful:"}],["$","p","*Reading",{"children":"*Reading"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
c:["$","section","*Learning something new (language, hobby, skill)",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"*Learning something new (language, hobby, skill)"}],[["$","p","*Working on a side project or business",{"children":"*Working on a side project or business"}],["$","p","*Exercising, gym, yoga",{"children":"*Exercising, gym, yoga"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
d:["$","section","“Go for a mediation retreat. Enjoy your time with yourself and explore your mind.”",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"“Go for a mediation retreat. Enjoy your time with yourself and explore your mind.”"}],[["$","p","“Comfort is your biggest trap and coming out of comfort zone is your biggest challenge” – Manoj Arora . A well said quote by Manoj Arora . I understand that getting out of your comfort is a difficult task but it’s one of the tip to overcome homesickness because sticking to same old routine, comfort could never help you achieve your big goals in life. Try making yourself flexible in every situation you already won half the battle if you can adjust in any situation. If you become too attached to where you are and who you are ,you can’t grow , you can’t evolve, or expand the best version of yourself Give up on excuses.",{"children":"“Comfort is your biggest trap and coming out of comfort zone is your biggest challenge” – Manoj Arora . A well said quote by Manoj Arora . I understand that getting out of your comfort is a difficult task but it’s one of the tip to overcome homesickness because sticking to same old routine, comfort could never help you achieve your big goals in life. Try making yourself flexible in every situation you already won half the battle if you can adjust in any situation. If you become too attached to where you are and who you are ,you can’t grow , you can’t evolve, or expand the best version of yourself Give up on excuses."}],["$","p","keeping yourself physically fit is okay but keeping yourself mentally fit is important. There are gonna be times where you would loose yourself, wave of sadness,distress,anxiety will hit you. But, keeping yourself away from all of these is the trick. Firstly, you gotta train your mind to be stronger than your emotions or else you’ll lose yourself every time. Secondly, distance yourself from negative thoughts and feelings . avoid overthinking or stressing about things it will get you no where and lastly, make a habit of meditating every day. Learn more about your cognitive thinking.",{"children":"keeping yourself physically fit is okay but keeping yourself mentally fit is important. There are gonna be times where you would loose yourself, wave of sadness,distress,anxiety will hit you. But, keeping yourself away from all of these is the trick. Firstly, you gotta train your mind to be stronger than your emotions or else you’ll lose yourself every time. Secondly, distance yourself from negative thoughts and feelings . avoid overthinking or stressing about things it will get you no where and lastly, make a habit of meditating every day. Learn more about your cognitive thinking."}],["$","p","Here are some apps to help yourself :-",{"children":"Here are some apps to help yourself :-"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Leave your comfort zone behind :-",{"children":"Leave your comfort zone behind :-"}],["$","li","Keep your mental health above everything :-",{"children":"Keep your mental health above everything :-"}]]}]]}]
e:["$","section","i) Calm (meditation and sleep app)",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"i) Calm (meditation and sleep app)"}],[["$","p","ii) Headspace (meditation and sleep app)",{"children":"ii) Headspace (meditation and sleep app)"}],["$","p","iii) Gratitude (self care journal )",{"children":"iii) Gratitude (self care journal )"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
f:["$","section","iv) Fit mind (mental fitness)",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"iv) Fit mind (mental fitness)"}],[["$","p","Everytime you feel like giving up, remind yourself everyday that why you chose to move abroad , what made you take this decision at first because anyone can give up it’s so easy to do. But you gotta hold your strength and move forward. Self motivate yourself . start believing in yourself, you are braver than you think. More talented than you know.",{"children":"Everytime you feel like giving up, remind yourself everyday that why you chose to move abroad , what made you take this decision at first because anyone can give up it’s so easy to do. But you gotta hold your strength and move forward. Self motivate yourself . start believing in yourself, you are braver than you think. More talented than you know."}],["$","p","If you are anxious about getting homesick or doubting yourself again and again to move abroad , talk to our certified yet experienced consultants for FREE NOW!",{"children":"If you are anxious about getting homesick or doubting yourself again and again to move abroad , talk to our certified yet experienced consultants for FREE NOW!"}],["$","p","One window overseas education offers one-stop solutions for all overseas educational needs. One Window has already helped around 6,500students to get admission. We provide you complete guide and clear all your doubts about moving abroad.",{"children":"One window overseas education offers one-stop solutions for all overseas educational needs. One Window has already helped around 6,500students to get admission. We provide you complete guide and clear all your doubts about moving abroad."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Remind yourself why you chose to move abroad:-",{"children":"Remind yourself why you chose to move abroad:-"}]]}]]}]
